{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "dd95d63aa48c4e0dc0d5cc70e53062c0c260266503e74259e969412aea049d40", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！\nここにいたんですね。探しましたよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n原来你在这啊，我找你好久了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "03a21e8044d5b5d1034e236f62c3276ed0b0fc6ed56faca3f9e8ae7e15872364", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。俺を探していたってことは、\nまた社長から、何か大事な話があるんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。你在找我就代表……\n社长是不是又有什么重要的事情要跟我说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "9552e0f50231f1e48da55371320a3c8b8db83d6bb8e396ed5e3b11f8ae3a78b3", "ja": "はい！　なんと、{$P$}さんの\n例の企画が、ついに実現するそうですよ！", "zh": "是的！有个大消息，\n{$P$}先生的那个企划终于要实现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b90b038bdb8f8553784c4d8cc311181eb23a6a26bf6bb2752d442ef96418a2e0", "ja": "えっ、あの企画が……！？\nそうですか、教えてくれてありがとうございます！", "zh": "咦，你是说那个企划……！？\n这样啊，谢谢你告诉我这件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "21cf7b1b243d38b01895a0be02b96aa3e08bd893596da58dd40adcf91e45c4ef", "ja": "いえいえ！　詳しいことは、社長さんから\n聞いてください！　それじゃあ、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "别这么说！至于详情就听社长说明吧！\n那么，请慢走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "019b742ca3540dbd46beb6cd7ef51e977057bac0c56469275f9711208f3a26d2", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。……あれ？\n音無さん、どうして、そんな暗い顔を……。", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！\n……咦？音无小姐，为什么你的表情这么沮丧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "e7293f9ff027255e23d60c3a8910ddb05670c2ec104b5279aa8e724e45be4bb4", "ja": "うう、実は、さっき体重を測ってみたんですけど……。\nちょっと信じたくない数字が出ちゃいまして……。", "zh": "呜呜，其实是我刚刚量体重……\n结果出现了让我不想面对的数字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "7f7e1206421a697fb2a6c0967ff0bf366614b0438eb8288c5664829db50ee0ea", "ja": "このままじゃ乙女のピンチよ、小鳥……！\nダイエットのために、ヨガを習おうかしら……。", "zh": "这样下去会成为少女的危机啊，小鸟……！\n要不要为了减肥来学瑜伽呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "cdfb09f7367d5b5053b55a02314ec82001f5e7d7943fbc4bced53e79e730c4c7", "ja": "うむ、いい心がけだ！　運動は健康に良いからね。\n私も、何か運動をすべきか……。", "zh": "嗯，这个想法很好！运动对健康也很有帮助。\n我也该找一项运动来做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "b224c30a4f8677d040725a360d469b7f63d207c2bb460a030e803ca950dfa251", "ja": "おお、そうだ。せっかくの機会だ。\nみんなで一緒にヨガをやらないかね？", "zh": "哦哦，对了，机会难得，\n要不要大家一起做瑜伽呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1d24761013693fb8d3aadd9f4784291043db8d5296b94d8a3627aa9f377440a3", "ja": "ええと、ちょっと考えさせてください。\nそれより社長！　青羽さんから聞きましたよ。", "zh": "呃，请让我考虑一下。\n话说，社长！我听青羽小姐说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1d6679e789c99a74b4e33e550cecc35b84473b8e2e85978da0f74ef9cc2f3c45", "ja": "あの企画が、いよいよ動き出すそうですね！", "zh": "那个企划终于要开始执行了是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "beaaf0e2f0a95f4d68864e43e594bae93f105c47e456dcc712d03c1ec5badeea", "ja": "うむ！　君が提出してくれた企画書を読んだが……、\n実に面白くなりそうじゃないか！", "zh": "嗯！我看了你提出的企划书……\n感觉会非常有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "b32640ed280902b0977d2f2aa845bf6aca8c55e741eafba69b3335a0c32d521b", "ja": "まさか、演劇をメインにしたステージとはね……。\n劇場としても初の試みだ。私も楽しみにしているよ！", "zh": "没想到你会提出以戏剧为主的表演……\n对剧场来说也是全新的尝试。我也很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b95956b0a1ffd1b24870d08d2b96727bafcf6acccdd589624c0b1a81548af32a", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "是的，谢谢社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "06bbcb330106c459d0cb21203e6135fa7e5fe7937f9fcf4296b762d1e759eb71", "ja": "この劇……『昏き星、遠い月』に出演する\nメンバーは、もう決まっているんだったね。", "zh": "要演出这出舞台剧……『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的成员，\n都已经决定好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "18429def5f9527d4264fc74ea71162689e1d9186db74b98818bdd0dc6b64f781", "ja": "はい！　莉緒、恵美、昴、伊織……。\nそして、主演は朋花と千鶴さんに任せようと思います。", "zh": "是的！成员有莉绪、惠美、昴、伊织……\n然后主角我想让朋花和千鹤来担任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "afe155632a8e133decd280a8476d631779520a11e9f5afea259425454aad9c5b", "ja": "そうか。彼女達なら、必ずや素晴らしい演技を\n見せてくれるだろう！　頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "这样啊。我想她们一定可以表现出精湛的演技！\n好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "3caccfd3057168b300e365ff08fdf44ab44797b0af1830847a89639f3206e6ef", "ja": "美咲ちゃんも、ホラーや吸血鬼ものが\n大好きなんだそうです。", "zh": "美咲她呀，\n好像也很喜欢惊悚类型跟吸血鬼的题材。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "875d7f7bc0b34c4d87ed635c143db84e3821452ea4994dbe78433fef4bdd756d", "ja": "みんなにピッタリな衣装を作ってみせるって、\nとっても張り切っていましたよ♪", "zh": "她说会做出最适合大家的服装，\n干劲十足喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1f615b75147d72ca9cb79202e351a46cb2e6a55196c81c67a9192d4a55d9a7f0", "ja": "それはありがたいです……！\nきっと、みんなの期待に応えてみせます！", "zh": "那真是太感谢了……！\n我一定会努力回应大家的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "0f15de6d2af81f0838e59f22cc7af59f16543b820bfbb618cd2aa798714681f1", "ja": "うむ、いい返事だ！　公演の結果次第では、\nDVDなど発売してもいいかもしれないな……。", "zh": "嗯，很棒的回答！\n视公演结果，说不定也可以考虑发行DVD之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "6b3c35467494dfcf24695cae39f9b3cfbca0287aa1bceffd4bb702a721c23de9", "ja": "詳細は、君に任せよう！　アイドル諸君と共に、\n公演を成功させてくれたまえ！", "zh": "其他细节就交给你处理！\n跟偶像们一起让公演成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0020_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "98066ef4275890b08c2592e9498186385d30b7bdbe8a7eeb92e469e9670a7d17", "ja": "（この企画は、765プロにとって新しい挑戦になる。\nみんなと力を合わせて、必ず成功させよう！）", "zh": "（这项企划对765艺能来说是一个新的挑战。\n要跟大家同心协力，务必让企划成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
